Z||000019||GodSend||08-13-2001||12:37 AM||||Ed,<P>"(Psychiatrists are doctors and can prescribe medicine, for all that don't know)"<P>Thanks for the tip.  I typically read your messages (and other peoples replies to them) without really wanting or caring to reply, but...<P>Many of your messages remind me of scientific papers which I read at University. It was always a joy to read the exception to this rule, but for the most part the people writing these papers were so intent on showing the reader how smart they were, how articulate they were, and how they could use simingly huge words to convince everyone of how smart they were..<P>If only they had realized that the reader was dead asleep by the 3rd paragraph.  You seem to be much like these types of writers.  Very intelligent, but not very good at presenting yourself at a comfortable level.  It has nothing to do with "dumbing things down" or readers intelligence ( or a compairson to the writers) .  In fact, the more intelligent you are the more you should understand how to talk to people in order to the right response.<P>Don't take this as a flame, as I have nothing against you or anyone else on this forum (except the guys with nicer cars then mine)..<P>Who has the cracked EGR TUBE, I am the weakest link.. goodbye!<p>[This message has been edited by GodSend (edited 08-13-2001).]||||reg||1
